 "summary": "A family of medium-power PNP bipolar transistors in the four-lead SOT-223 surface-mount package, the PNP partners of BCP54, BCP55 and BCP56. BCP51, BCP52 and BCP53 differ in voltage rating (VCEO -45 V, -60 V and -80 V); each comes in two current-gain grades, -10 (63 to 160) and -16 (100 to 250). Collector current is rated at -1.0 A and dissipation at 1.5 W.",
 "key_figures": [
  [
   "Collector-base voltage VCBO",
   "-45 V (BCP51), -60 V (BCP52), -100 V (BCP53)"
  ],
